{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_42_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_42","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，齊人、宋人、陳人、蔡人、邾人會於北杏。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_42_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_42","textTraditional":"是齊侯、宋公也，其曰人何也？始疑之。何疑焉？桓非受命之伯也。將以事授之者也，曰可矣乎？未乎？舉人眾之辭也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_42_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_42","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，齊人滅遂。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_42_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_42","textTraditional":"遂，國也。其不日，微國也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_42_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_42","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_42_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_42","textTraditional":"四、冬，公會齊侯，盟於柯。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_42_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_42","textTraditional":"曹劌之盟也，信齊侯也。桓盟雖內與，不日，信也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}